{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Step into the shadowed past of Nichishima, a village in 1960s Japan, in this prequel chapter to the main game. As a newcomer in your final year of school, a classmate\u2019s sudden disappearance draws you into a chilling mystery. What begins as a search unravels into a third-person survival horror nightmare\u2014where reality frays, and every shadow hides a truth you can\u2019t trust. Can you escape Nichishima or will you lose yourself forever?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New way, old setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this expansion you will playing in 3rd person and with a new threat of horror in this survival horror experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the past of Nichishima in a new way</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limit ways to defend yourself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evade looming threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate, search and uncover lore to help peace together the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you escape Nichishima or will you become part of its unfortunate history\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More information coming soon!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548160?t=1742042217","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548160?t=1742042217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548160/e83ca51c4d82f0871302f3cc3f47efabb28d32f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742042217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548160/e83ca51c4d82f0871302f3cc3f47efabb28d32f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742042217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Con